## Why Rent a Laptop?

Renting a laptop can be useful when you need a computer for a limited period without purchasing a new device.

Common rental requirements include:

* Office and business work
* Student projects and online classes
* Temporary employees
* Corporate training
* Events and conferences
* Software testing
* Work-from-home requirements
* Temporary replacement during laptop repair

## Choosing the Right Laptop

Before renting a laptop, consider:

* Processor
* RAM
* SSD/storage
* Operating system
* Battery condition
* Screen size
* Required software
* Rental duration
* Technical support

Choose a configuration based on your actual workload rather than only looking at the rental price.

